      "en": "In October-April accommodation price in Villa Paratiisi is 480€ for the first night and for all following 200 € / max 5+1 persons. Please see prices and accommodation options for extra persons below.  Price includes stay from 16 to 12 o'clock next day. Please notice: during Christmas and New Years, price is 880 € for the first night and for all following 580 € / max. 12 persons, with minimum staying period of 2 nights."
